  "summary": "Berkeley police arrested a wanted man after a Flock ALPR alert flagged his vehicle on Grizzly Peak Boulevard, leading to his arrest on Solano Avenue with a loaded machine gun. The suspect faces six felony charges spanning the new arrest and a prior January domestic violence and firearm case.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "A Flock alert Wednesday helped Berkeley police find a wanted man with a loaded gun in his waistband, authorities said.",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    },
    {
      "quote": "After police found Williams' DNA on a gun seized in January, they secured a warrant for his arrest, authorities said. That warrant ultimately led to this week's Flock alert.",
